   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRC is primarily contributing to the activities related to the programme outcome &quot;Inclusion: Children are in a safe environment in and around schools.&quot; This will involve working with the Government of Tanzania to develop and implement interventions to reduce violence in and around schools within the nine programme regions.</narrative>
